sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Model as Local Model<br/>(Orchestrator Role)
    participant Java as Java Application<br/>Orchestration Layer
    participant SIMD as Java Vector API<br/>SIMD Engine
    participant DB as JSON Lines Partition<br/>(.jsonl)
    participant AST as AST Pre-Flight Guard<br/>(JavaParser / Antlr)

    %% Discovery Workflow
    Note over Model, DB: Module Discovery Workflow
    Model->>Java: Invokes tool: find_module("strict file router")
    Java->>Java: Generates embedding vector from query string
    Java->>SIMD: Passes query vector (1536d / 3072d)
    DB->>SIMD: Stream memory-mapped float arrays across CPU lanes
    activate SIMD
    SIMD->>SIMD: FloatVector.fromArray() loops (AVX-512 / Neon)
    SIMD->>Java: Returns top matching Module IDs & Metadata
    deactivate SIMD
    Java->>Model: Returns clean, isolated module signatures (No raw source code)

    %% Module Construction & Validation Workflow
    Note over Model, AST: Module Contribution & Validation Workflow
    Model->>Java: Submits new module attempt for registration
    activate Java
    Java->>AST: Route raw snippet to Abstract Syntax Tree check
    activate AST
    Note over AST: Check 1: Lines count < 1000<br/>Check 2: Cyclomatic complexity limit<br/>Check 3: Reject magic numbers
    alt Fails Strict Guardrails
        AST-->>Java: Verification Error (e.g., God function detected)
        Java-->>Model: Rejection notification + code formatting feedback
    else Passes Guardrails
        AST-->>Java: Validated AST Structure
        deactivate AST
        Java->>Java: Compute SHA-256 Hash of code body
        Java->>DB: Append module registry line to target domain file (.jsonl)
        Java-->>Model: Registration successful (Returns canonical module ID)
    end
    deactivate Java